  "description": "A .NET library for reading, modifying, and saving password-encrypted Excel files. Built on NPOI with support for both reading encrypted files and saving with encryption using Excel automation. Perfect for applications that need to process secure Excel files while maintaining encryption. Supports .NET Standard 2.0, .NET 6.0, .NET 8.0, and .NET 9.0.",
